---
description: Keep spec guarantees in sync with kinds.GUARANTEES, and keep the survey overlap pins valid
globs: docs/spec.md,src/ubiq/kinds.py,tests/test_kinds.py,src/ubiq/overlap.py,src/ubiq/graph.py,tests/test_survey.py,tests/fixtures/**
alwaysApply: false
---

`GUARANTEES` in `src/ubiq/kinds.py` quotes sentences from `docs/spec.md` word for word.
`tests/test_kinds.py` fails when a quoted sentence changes.

- Edit a quoted spec sentence and its guarantee in the same change.
- When you add a `Context` member, add text for that region to the fixture document of the property test in `tests/test_kinds.py`.

`tests/test_survey.py` pins `ubiq overlap` output for the two surveyed skill repositories.
A change to block splitting, shingling, ownership, or include handling can change the pins.

- Keep `tests/test_survey.py` passing.
- Regenerate intended public fixture changes with `ubiq overlap --json` for each unit at the pinned input.
- For `tests/fixtures/survey-personal.json`, use the surveyed commit and the `locations()` projection in `tests/test_survey.py`.
  Keep the `paragraph` and `line` keys. Never save personal block text in this fixture.
- Explain each changed cluster in the commit message.
